  {
   "id": "slayers-x-terminal-aftermath-vengance-of-the-slayer-196655@major-2024-03-28",
   "gameId": "slayers-x-terminal-aftermath-vengance-of-the-slayer-196655",
   "displayName": "Update for Hypnospace Outlaw: Saves & Surprises Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-03-28T16:58:43.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're here to drop you a new update for Hypnospace Outlaw - the saves & surprises update!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We've made some changes to Steam Cloud Saves, alongside some cool new stuff in-game too! Here's what you can expect to find",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Updated the game engine to its most recent version",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Save location migrated for Steam Autocloud cloud-save support, and GlobalSettings save file is no longer synced",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Mod.io API update (they changed their API URL)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "The application window's close button is now captured by HypnOS, so when you click the to close, it will prompt you to log off first",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Two additional people added to credits, we're sorry this took so long!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "New default controller layout for a better experience on Steam Deck",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the in-game changes, spoiler warning if you want these to be a surprise",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Some changes to QueenOfSanderverse poetry, what shouldn't have been there is now GONE",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A popular, much loved Hypnospace user can now safely be flagged on any/all days, which could change the outcome of certain things...",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Hypii is now way more dynamic at the start of the HAP chapter - he might just pick up on the present!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HAP page-captured spin animation in the Explorer no longer gets \"stuck\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you all again for keeping the Hypnospace universe in check - it's thanks to you enforcers, that Hypnospace is a safe space free of copyright infringement, harassment, and violations! We'll see you next time!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
